---
description: Ensure all styled components satisfy WCAG AA/AAA contrast and keyboard accessibility.
globs: ["**/*.tsx", "**/*.jsx", "**/*.html", "**/*.vue"]
---

# Accessibility & WCAG Standards

1. Text contrast ratio against dark backgrounds must be at least 4.5:1 for normal text, 3:1 for large text.
2. Form controls must have accessible labels or `aria-label`.
3. Modal dialogs and command bars must capture focus and dismiss on `Escape`.
4. Focus indicators must be prominent (`focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-cyan-400`).
